law.text:
		In addition to the provisions of the rental agreement, the tenant shall:

Comply with applicable laws affecting manufactured home owners and tenants;


Keep and maintain the exterior of the tenant's manufactured home and manufactured home lot as clean and safe as conditions permit;


Place all garbage and other waste in the appropriate receptacles, which shall be provided by the tenant when door-to-door garbage and waste pickup is provided;


Use in a reasonable and orderly manner all facilities and appliances in the manufactured home park and require any guest or invitee to do so;


Conduct himself and require any guest or invitee to conduct himself in a manner that will not disturb the tenant's neighbors' peaceful enjoyment of the premises;


Abide by all reasonable rules and regulations imposed by the landlord; and


In the absence of express written agreement to the contrary, occupy the tenant's manufactured home only as a dwelling unit.
